Package: shinyVIVO
Type: Package
Title: An Interactive Mixed-Methods AI Coding Workbench
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Your", "Name", email = "b.osangir@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A point-and-click 'shiny' workbench for qualitative and
    mixed-methods researchers. Upload a spreadsheet of text responses,
    code them against a set of themes with a local large language model
    served by 'Ollama', and map the resulting codes against quantitative
    metrics. Text never leaves the researcher's machine.
